# ******************************************************************
# * File         : .gitattributes
# * Application  : CardDemo
# * Type         : Git path attributes
# * Function     : Establishes deterministic line endings for the newly created
# *                Java build tree while guaranteeing that the frozen legacy
# *                corpus is never touched. The COBOL sources, copybooks, BMS
# *                mapsets, JCL members and ASCII fixtures under app/ use CRLF
# *                terminators and must remain byte-for-byte identical, because
# *                app/ is simultaneously the parity oracle, the field-contract
# *                source and the traceability anchor. A blanket `* text=auto`
# *                would renormalise them and is therefore deliberately absent;
# *                app/, samples/ and diagrams/ are pinned with -text below.
